## Credentials

If credentials are missing, stop and direct the user to the product's external authentication documentation. Never request, echo, store, or log a credential in chat or generated files.

## Boundaries

This skill supports operating the local CLI only. Direct API calls and MCP activity are unsupported by this skill.

It does not include plugin manifests, MCP configuration, hosted-tool descriptors, marketplace packaging, OAuth wiring, permission policy, or product API client instructions.
